"が連邦レベルで一元管理しており、電子申請に対する政府手数料は無料です。 `EAR734 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `EAR742 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/742>`_ `SNAPR "
"<https://snapr.bis.gov/help/SNAPR-FAQ.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:121
msgid "Four Steps to Classify or Obtain US Export Approval"
msgstr "米国の該非判定・輸出許可を取得する4ステップ"

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Step 1: Establish jurisdiction and publication status:** Check the exact "
"artifact under 734.3, 734.7, 734.8 and the 4E091 notes. Qualifying published"
" material can be outside the EAR; an item that is merely eligible for no "
"license to one destination can still be subject to the EAR. Part 744 "
"requirements generally concern items subject to the EAR, while other "
"sanctions and US-person rules require separate analysis. `EAR734 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `EAR744 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/744>`_ `EAR774 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/774>`_"
msgstr ""
" **管轄と公開状態から：**  "
"734.3、734.7、734.8、4E091を確認。公知資料の対象外と、EAR対象だが一仕向地に許可不要なのは別です。744は基本的に対象品、他制裁・米国人規則は別途検討します。"
" `EAR734 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `EAR744 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/744>`_ `EAR774 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/774>`_"

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:125
msgid ""
"**Step 2: Obtain a Company Identification Number (CIN) on SNAP-R:** Parties "
"exporting controlled hardware (``3A090``), chip equipment, or private "
"controlled technology register online for a CIN on BIS's **Simplified "
"Network Application Process Redesign (SNAP-R)** portal at "
"``https://snapr.bis.gov`` (US-located parties submit Export License "
"applications, while parties abroad may submit Reexport License or Commodity "
"Classification requests) `EAR734 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_"
" `SNAPR <https://snapr.bis.gov/help/SNAPR-FAQ.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
" **ステップ2：SNAP-Rで企業識別番号（CIN）を取得する：**  規制対象ハードウェア（ ``3A090`` "
"）、半導体製造装置、または非公開の規制技術を輸出する事業者は、BISの  **SNAP-R（Simplified Network Application"
" Process Redesign）**  ポータル（ ``https://snapr.bis.gov`` "
"）でオンライン登録を行いCINを取得します（米国内の事業者は輸出許可申請を、米国外の事業者は再輸出許可申請やCCATS該非判定請求を提出可能です）。 "
"`EAR734 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `SNAPR "
"<https://snapr.bis.gov/help/SNAPR-FAQ.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Step 3: File a Commodity Classification (CCATS) or Policy Inquiry if "
"uncertain:** Submit technical specifications as a Commodity Classification "
"Work Item on ``snapr.bis.gov`` to receive an official ECCN determination "
"(``ACN`` tracking number), or contact BIS's Regulatory Policy Division for "
"rule interpretation `EAR734 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ "
"`SNAPR <https://snapr.bis.gov/help/SNAPR-FAQ.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
" **ステップ3：判断に迷う場合はCCATS該非判定または政策照会を行う：**  ``snapr.bis.gov`` "
"上で技術仕様書を添えて品目分類請求（CCATS Work Item）を提出し公式のECCN判定（追跡用の ``ACN`` "
"番号が付与されます）を受けるか、BISの規制政策課（Regulatory Policy Division）へ規則解釈を照会します。 `EAR734 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `SNAPR "
"<https://snapr.bis.gov/help/SNAPR-FAQ.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:127
msgid ""
"**Step 4: Submit License Application & Track via STELA:** Upload PDF "
"supporting documents, end-user statements, and technical specs (for January "
"2026 China/Macau chip reviews under ``742.6(b)(10)``, attach certifications "
"of ``TPP < 21,000``, ``DRAM bandwidth < 6,500 GB/s``, US supply adequacy, "
"KYC security, and independent US lab verification) `US26 "
"<https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2026-01-15/html/2026-00789.htm>`_ "
"`EAR742 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/742>`_ `SNAPR "
"<https://snapr.bis.gov/help/SNAPR-FAQ.pdf>`_. Track status on **STELA** "
"(``https://snapr.bis.gov/public/stela``) `EAR734 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_."
msgstr ""
" **ステップ4：輸出許可申請を提出し、STELAで審査状況を追跡する：**  "
"裏付け資料PDF、最終需要者誓約書、技術仕様書をアップロードします（2026年1月の ``742.6(b)(10)`` "
"に基づく中国・マカオ向けチップ審査では、 ``TPP < 21,000`` 、 ``DRAM bandwidth < 6,500 GB/s`` "
"、米国内供給の充足、KYCセキュリティ管理、および米国独立試験機関による検証の各証明書を添付）。 `US26 "
"<https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2026-01-15/html/2026-00789.htm>`_ "
"`EAR742 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/742>`_ `SNAPR "
"<https://snapr.bis.gov/help/SNAPR-FAQ.pdf>`_ 提出後の審査状況は  **STELA**  （ "
"``https://snapr.bis.gov/public/stela`` ）で追跡できます。 `EAR734 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_"

